      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKET LAUNCHER (8) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a third place finish (17.83) there the start prior. Has winning claims on his best figures. SMOOTH BUBBLES (3) bolted in last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in slick time (17.58) to take a Maiden in a new PB this course and distance. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. MINH SASHA (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (24.15) last time in a Novice race at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Cannot be underestimated. TERRA FIRMA (2) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
